Error [E0119]: `_` isn't a type
  --> tests/ui/type_hole_failure_domain.jet:13:28
    |
 13 | fn doubled(raw: String) -> Int _! {
    |                            ^^^^^^
 Why: A signature names every type; `_` is only a pattern wildcard
 Fix: Write the type out; in a `T _!` return, name the error domain the body fails with, such as `Int ParseError!`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0119
